{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfhNzaKmuxYvVbgHgWBvE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The race is fixed: only the most recent `search()` call can now update results, loading, or errors, and a cleared query stays cleared.\n\n**Cause:** in `src/search/controller.ts`, every request wrote its outcome into state when it settled, regardless of whether a newer search had started since.\n\n**Fix:** the controller now numbers each `search()` call, and a request only applies its results, error, or `loading: false` if it is still the latest one. Clearing the query also counts as a new call, so any in-flight request is ignored when it finishes. The change is 6 lines added and 3 removed in that one file; the public API, the API adapter, the view and the tests are untouched.\n\n**Verification:**\n- The existing suite (`npm test`) passes, 4 of 4.\n- A temporary race check with manually resolved requests, run from outside the repo and then deleted, passed for three cases:\n  - a stale success is ignored and loading stays on;\n  - a stale error is ignored;\n  - a request that finishes after the query is cleared does not repopulate results.\n\nThe repo itself still has no regression test for the race, since you asked me not to modify tests.\n\nSuperseded requests are ignored rather than cancelled, so they still run to completion on the network. Actually aborting them would mean passing an `AbortSignal` through `SearchApi.search`, which changes the public interface, so I left it out.\n\nNothing is committed; the change is in the working tree."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1745,"cache_read_input_tokens":10283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1745},"output_tokens":457,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd85aa79-6e18-48d2-87cc-447801d066b1","uuid":"a51b04c2-f301-4ab0-b8b4-dcd4a1b6bf73","timestamp":"2026-10-04T14:47:40.524Z","request_id":"req_011CfhNzZbd5dvRPSqG6KedA"}
